<title>DUBAI: Saudi Aramco lifts Red Sea bunker prices.</title>
<headline>Saudi Aramco lifts Red Sea bunker prices.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Aramco has increased A-960 bunker fuel exported from Jeddah and Yanbu by $3 a tonne to $131 ($20.11 a barrel) with effect October 17, it said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>A-960 from the Gulf is unchanged at $127 a tonne ($19.49) as is A-888 bunker diesel at $220 a tonne from all ports.</p>
<p>-- Dubai Newsroom +971 4 6071255</p>
</text>
